---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="SOLUVIRTUS - Consultora de Tecnología y Desarrollo">
	<!-- Navigation -->
	<nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 bg-brand-bg-light/80 dark:bg-brand-bg-dark/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-brand-bg-darkSecondary transition-colors duration-300">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="flex items-center justify-between h-20">
				<div class="flex items-center">
					<a href="#" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent dark:shadow-neon-glow transition-all duration-300">
						S O L U V I R T U S
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="hidden md:block">
					<div class="ml-10 flex items-baseline space-x-6">
						<a href="#services" class="text-sm font-medium hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Especialidades</a>
						<a href="#projects" class="text-sm font-medium hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Proyectos</a>
						<a href="#philosophie" class="text-sm font-medium hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Filosofía</a>
						<a href="#contact" class="text-sm font-medium hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Contacto</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
					<!-- Theme Toggles -->
					<div class="flex items-center bg-slate-200/50 dark:bg-brand-bg-darkSecondary p-1 rounded-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-800 transition-colors">
						<button id="theme-light" class="p-1.5 rounded-full text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:hover:text-brand-accent hover:bg-white dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all" title="Modo Claro">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v2.25m6.364.386-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0Z" /></svg>
						</button>
						<button id="theme-system" class="p-1.5 rounded-full text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:hover:text-brand-accent hover:bg-white dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all" title="Preferencia del Sistema">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 0 1-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0 1 15 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 5.25m18 0V12a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.25" /></svg>
						</button>
						<button id="theme-dark" class="p-1.5 rounded-full text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:hover:text-brand-accent hover:bg-white dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all" title="Modo Oscuro">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.72 9.72 0 0 1 18 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 0 0 3 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 0 0 9.002-5.998Z" /></svg>
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</nav>

	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center pt-24 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-100 to-white dark:from-brand-bg-dark dark:to-brand-bg-darkSecondary transition-colors duration-300">
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center opacity-10 dark:opacity-20 transition-opacity" style="background-image: url('/images/hero_bg.png');"></div>
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-sky-200/20 via-transparent to-transparent dark:from-brand-accent/5 dark:via-transparent dark:to-transparent"></div>
		<div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
			<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
				Acelera, Delega y Simplifica tu trabajo
			</h1>
			<p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-light text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent/90 dark:drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,240,255,0.3)] mb-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
				&gt; Agilización _ Automatización
			</p>
			<div class="text-base sm:text-xl font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8 min-h-[4rem] sm:min-h-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
				<span>Excelente para:</span>
				<span id="dynamic-word" class="text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent border-r-2 border-brand-accent-light dark:border-brand-accent pr-1 font-bold">Delegar Tareas</span>
			</div>
			<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
				Soluvirtus es una consultora de tecnología enfocada en la automatización de negocios, la ingeniería de software a la medida y la integración de soluciones avanzadas de IA en flujos de trabajo prácticos. Priorizando el paradigma <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">"agent-first"</span>.
			</p>
			<div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
				<a href="#services" class="px-8 py-3 bg-brand-accent-light hover:bg-brand-accent-lightHover dark:bg-brand-accent dark:hover:bg-brand-accent-hover text-white dark:text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/20 dark:shadow-brand-accent/20">
					Especialidades
				</a>
				<a href="#contact" class="px-8 py-3 bg-transparent hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-white/5 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg font-bold transition-all">
					Contáctanos
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Especialidades -->
	<section id="services" class="py-24 bg-white dark:bg-brand-bg-dark border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-brand-bg-darkSecondary transition-colors duration-300">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
				<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Especializaciones y Experiencia Central</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary">Ayudamos a las empresas a escalar reemplazando herramientas heredadas por ecosistemas digitales modernos y autónomos.</p>
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				<!-- Card 1 -->
				<div class="p-8 bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-brand-bg-darkSecondary/40 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-brand-accent-light dark:hover:border-brand-accent/50 shadow-sm dark:shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] transition-all duration-300 group">
					<img src="/images/ai_automation.png" alt="Automatización Inteligente" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl mb-6 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800" />
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors duration-300"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 3v1.5M4.5 8.25H3m18 0h-1.5M12 18.75V21m-4.75-8.25h9.5m-9.5 3h9.5m-9.5-6h9.5M8.25 6.75h7.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v7.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H8.25a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5-1.5V8.25a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5-1.5Z" /></svg>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Automatización Inteligente</h3>
					</div>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary leading-relaxed">
						Diseño y despliegue de sistemas de IA a la medida, scrapers personalizados y asistentes operativos que automatizan la extracción de datos, la generación de catálogos y la gestión de prospectos (leads).
					</p>
				</div>
				<!-- Card 2 -->
				<div class="p-8 bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-brand-bg-darkSecondary/40 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-brand-accent-light dark:hover:border-brand-accent/50 shadow-sm dark:shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] transition-all duration-300 group">
					<img src="/images/fullstack_dev.png" alt="Desarrollo Full-Stack" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl mb-6 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800" />
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors duration-300"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 6.75 22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3-4.5 16.5" /></svg>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Desarrollo Full-Stack</h3>
					</div>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary leading-relaxed">
						Ingeniería de aplicaciones web y plataformas de comercio electrónico de alto rendimiento utilizando un stack moderno y seguro, basado principalmente en Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS y Supabase con seguridad robusta a nivel de fila (RLS).
					</p>
				</div>
				<!-- Card 3 -->
				<div class="p-8 bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-brand-bg-darkSecondary/40 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-brand-accent-light dark:hover:border-brand-accent/50 shadow-sm dark:shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] transition-all duration-300 group">
					<img src="/images/sovereign_infra.png" alt="Infraestructura Soberana e IA Local" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl mb-6 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800" />
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors duration-300"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.57-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z" /></svg>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Infraestructura Soberana e IA Local</h3>
					</div>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary leading-relaxed">
						Compromiso firme con la privacidad de los datos, el control de costos y la soberanía tecnológica. Desarrollamos entornos locales personalizados, LLMs de código abierto y flujos remotos móviles a través de Termux, Tasker y SSH.
					</p>
				</div>
				<!-- Card 4 -->
				<div class="p-8 bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-brand-bg-darkSecondary/40 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-brand-accent-light dark:hover:border-brand-accent/50 shadow-sm dark:shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] transition-all duration-300 group">
					<img src="/images/premium_design.png" alt="Diseño UI/UX Premium" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl mb-6 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800" />
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-brand-accent-light dark:group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors duration-300"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 21m0 0l-.813-5.096M9 21h3.75m-6.75 0H9m9.813-5.096L19.5 21m0 0l-.813-5.096M19.5 21h3.75m-6.75 0h3.75m-9.813-5.096a6.75 6.75 0 0110.125-9.75M9.813 15.904A6.75 6.75 0 1019.5 15.9m-9.687-9.69a6.75 6.75 0 019.687 0" /></svg>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Diseño UI/UX Premium</h3>
					</div>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary leading-relaxed">
						Creación de experiencias digitales sofisticadas y de alta gama, orientadas a estéticas pulidas y de alto contraste que resaltan la fotografía de producto de alta calidad y el branding exclusivo de su marca.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Proyectos -->
	<section id="projects" class="py-24 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-brand-bg-darkSecondary border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-brand-bg-darkSecondary transition-colors duration-300">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
				<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Proyectos Clave e Impacto</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary">Entregamos soluciones tecnológicas de extremo a extremo con impacto medible en diversos sectores.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Mobile View (Cards) -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:hidden">
				<div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-brand-bg-dark rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
					<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 text-base">Automatización de Catálogos Empresariales</h4>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">Gestión automatizada e integración de un asesor de IA para inventarios masivos de retail (más de 2,400 productos).</p>
					<span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-sky-100 dark:bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">Integración de IA, Automatización</span>
				</div>
				<div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-brand-bg-dark rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
					<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 text-base">Motores de Comercio Electrónico Premium</h4>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">Entrega de punta a punta de tiendas boutique de alta gama, incluyendo enrutamiento de dominios personalizados y lógica transaccional optimizada.</p>
					<span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-sky-100 dark:bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">Next.js, Supabase, Tailwind</span>
				</div>
				<div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-brand-bg-dark rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
					<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 text-base">Generación de Leads Inmobiliarios</h4>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">Herramientas de extracción de datos (scraping) especializadas y optimización de instrucciones (prompt engineering) para capturar, filtrar y cerrar prospectos de propiedades.</p>
					<span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-sky-100 dark:bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">Extracción de Datos, Orquestación de LLMs</span>
				</div>
				<div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-brand-bg-dark rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
					<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 text-base">Desarrollo de IDE Soberano</h4>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">Construcción de un entorno de desarrollo localizado y de código libre con memoria local integrada para mantener una estricta autonomía de datos.</p>
					<span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-sky-100 dark:bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">LLMs Locales, Herramientas de Desarrollo</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Desktop View (Table) -->
			<div class="hidden md:block overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-brand-bg-dark shadow-sm">
				<table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
					<thead>
						<tr class="bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-brand-bg-darkSecondary border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-850">
							<th class="p-6 text-sm font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Proyecto / Iniciativa</th>
							<th class="p-6 text-sm font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Alcance e Impacto</th>
							<th class="p-6 text-sm font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Enfoque Tecnológico</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800">
						<tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
							<td class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Automatización de Catálogos Empresariales</td>
							<td class="p-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary">Gestión automatizada e integración de un asesor de IA para inventarios masivos de retail (más de 2,400 productos).</td>
							<td class="p-6 text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent font-semibold">Integración de IA, Automatización</td>
						</tr>
						<tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
							<td class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Motores de Comercio Electrónico Premium</td>
							<td class="p-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary">Entrega de punta a punta de tiendas boutique de alta gama, incluyendo enrutamiento de dominios personalizados y lógica transaccional optimizada.</td>
							<td class="p-6 text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent font-semibold">Next.js, Supabase, Tailwind</td>
						</tr>
						<tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
							<td class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Generación de Leads Inmobiliarios</td>
							<td class="p-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary">Herramientas de extracción de datos (scraping) especializadas y optimización de instrucciones (prompt engineering) para capturar, filtrar y cerrar prospectos de propiedades.</td>
							<td class="p-6 text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent font-semibold">Extracción de Datos, Orquestación de LLMs</td>
						</tr>
						<tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
							<td class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Desarrollo de IDE Soberano</td>
							<td class="p-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary">Construcción de un entorno de desarrollo localizado y de código libre con memoria local integrada para mantener una estricta autonomía de datos.</td>
							<td class="p-6 text-brand-accent-light dark:text-brand-accent font-semibold">LLMs Locales, Herramientas de Desarrollo</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Filosofía -->
	<section id="philosophie" class="py-24 bg-white dark:bg-brand-bg-dark border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-brand-bg-darkSecondary transition-colors duration-300">
		<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6">La Filosofía de Soluvirtus</h2>
			<blockquote class="text-xl italic text-slate-700 dark:text-brand-text-darkSecondary leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-brand-accent-light dark:border-brand-accent pl-6 text-left max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
				"La tecnología debe servir como un activo soberano y funcional. Al priorizar la ejecución de IA local y una arquitectura full-stack robusta, las empresas pueden maximizar su retorno de inversión mientras mantienen la propiedad absoluta de sus datos y su infraestructura."
			</blockquote>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Contacto -->
	<section id="contact" class="py-24 bg-slate-900 text-white dark:bg-brand-bg-dark border-t border-slate-800 dark:border-brand-bg-darkSecondary transition-colors duration-300">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
				<div>
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-4">Contacto</h2>
					<p class="text-slate-400 dark:text-brand-text-muted mb-8 leading-relaxed">
						¿Interesado en implementar automatizaciones robustas e inteligentes en tu negocio o migrar sistemas heredados a stacks modernos de IA soberana? Hablemos hoy.
					</p>
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<p class="flex items-center text-slate-300">
